  "notes": "ACCESS CAVEAT: azahcccs.gov returns HTTP 403 to this machine (non-US IP, Azure gateway) and to WebFetch. The official file was therefore downloaded as the byte-for-byte Wayback Machine capture of the official URL (http://web.archive.org/web/20260913131615id_/https://www.azahcccs.gov/PlansProviders/Downloads/FFSrates/Dental/FY27_DentalRates_10012026.xlsx, captured 2026-09-13); the file list was read from the Wayback capture of the official Dental FFS Rates page (2026-06-07, which listed 'Rates Effective January 1, 2026' as newest; the FY27 10/01/2026 file was posted later). Recommend re-downloading from the official URL from a US connection to confirm. 'FFS Rate' column used; a separate 'Flagstaff Rate' column (about +10% for many codes, e.g. D0120 32.71, D7140 96.35) is not recorded. Single schedule for all ages (population 'all'); coverage limits (adult emergency dental benefit cap, child EPSDT) are in the AHCCCS Medical Policy Manual, not in the schedule. AHCCCS states that a code/rate appearing does not mean the service is covered. Most AHCCCS members are in managed care; this is the FFS capped fee schedule (used as benchmark by MCOs/DBAs).",
